		{"id":"bcefd80db595ed86","x":-139,"y":-404,"width":519,"height":164,"type":"text","text":"==The Philippines grows a massive amount of rice==—producing around 19 million metric tons of paddy rice (palay) a year—but it still cannot grow enough to feed its population and frequently ranks as one of the world's largest rice importers."}
